B.c2P=new A.dr("Using the service","You must provide accurate account information, keep your credentials secure, and use the service only for lawful barber discovery, booking, business-profile, shop-management, physical-product ordering, hair-community, review, and messaging purposes. You are responsible for activity on your account.")
B.c2G=new A.dr("Bookings and services","The app helps clients, independent barbers, and shop barbers coordinate appointments. Barbers and shop owners are responsible for the services they offer, their prices, availability, professional licensing, and any offline payment or cancellation terms. A booking request is not confirmed until the barber accepts it. Future appointments with an owner or then-approved shop barber are stamped to that shop when booked so its owner can see the customer identifier, display name and photo, most recent shop appointment time, and booked barber name needed for shop service. The contact view does not include service or status. Earlier appointments are not backfilled from a barber\u2019s current or former membership.")
B.c2T=new A.dr("Shop management records","A barber may remain independent, create one shop as its owner, or request to join a shop. A shop relationship begins only after the owner approves the request. Owners may reject requests or remove a barber from their shop, but that action does not delete the barber\u2019s app account. Owners and barbers are responsible for having any notice, consent, and legal basis required to record workplace attendance and business figures. Sales, expenses, hours, and net figures are manually entered operational notes\u2014not verified payments, payroll, tax advice, insurance records, or accounting records.")
B.c2K=new A.dr("Shop messages","An owner may use contact-safe details from a shop-stamped appointment to start a separate shop-customer conversation for booking and service support. That does not give the owner access to the customer\u2019s private direct conversation with the barber. An owner and approved barber may start an ordinary one-to-one direct conversation; leaving or removal from the shop does not revoke or delete that already-created direct conversation. Team announcements are owner-only and available only to currently approved staff; access ends when a barber leaves or is removed. Shop customer access must not be used for unrelated advertising, bulk solicitation, impersonation, or disclosure to other staff or customers.")
B.c2q=new A.dr("Physical products and pickup orders","The store offers physical hair-care products supplied by the service operator. Submitting an order is a request to reserve the listed quantity for pickup; it is not an online payment. The current app does not collect card, bank-account, or wallet credentials. Product descriptions, availability, and prices may be corrected before an order is accepted. Payment, pickup, returns, and refunds follow the operator terms communicated for the order and applicable consumer law.")
B.c2B=new A.dr("Hair-care information","Hair-community articles and posts are for general education and personal experience only. They are not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment and do not replace a qualified health professional. User claims are not verified. Do not delay care, stop prescribed treatment, or take a supplement or medicine because of app content. Seek appropriate professional help for persistent, sudden, severe, or concerning symptoms.")
B.c2Z=new A.dr("User content","You keep responsibility for content you upload or send and grant the service permission to host, review, process, and display it as needed to operate and moderate the requested features. Hair-community submissions are held for review and may be approved, rejected, or removed. Approval does not verify a health claim or endorse a product. Do not upload content you do not have the right to use.")
B.c2m=new A.dr("Safety and enforcement","We may remove content, restrict features, suspend accounts, or cooperate with lawful requests when necessary to enforce these terms, protect users, or secure the service. Users may report supported direct-message content. A safety action in a shop-customer conversation or team announcement instead reports the sender\u2019s account, not the shop message or announcement itself. Users can block abusive accounts in the app. Blocking stops new direct interaction but does not cancel an appointment or end a shop membership. If your account is suspended, you may use Support to request review and quote the case reference shown in the app.")
B.c2n=new A.dr("Shop access, retention, and account deletion","Leaving or removal from a shop ends team-announcement access but does not revoke or delete an already-created ordinary owner-staff direct conversation, the barber\u2019s account, or shop-stamped appointment and message records. Those records remain subject to the retention, reporting, dispute, and legal-hold rules in the Privacy Policy. Account deletion removes live channel participation and account-owned product data; restricted safety or legal records may be kept only under the disclosed retention and deletion or pseudonymization rules.")
B.c2z=new A.dr("Electronic acceptance and policy updates","Selecting the agreement checkbox and tapping Accept records your electronic acceptance of the exact Terms of Service and Community Guidelines versions shown in the app. Acceptance is saved to your account and applies across your devices. You will be asked to accept again only when the current Terms or Guidelines version changes. Material updates will be communicated through the app or the contact information associated with your account. The Privacy Policy explains how information is handled; it is a notice and is not included in this agreement checkbox.")
B.c2H=new A.dr("Changes and availability","Features may change as the service improves, and uninterrupted availability is not guaranteed.")
